    {"file":"packages/foundation/ui-system/dock/src/Geometry.models.ts","symbol":"GeometryOptions","kind":"struct-const","owner":"@beep/dock","identity":"GeometryOptions","description":"Gap, minimum sash hit thickness, and global per-leaf minimum extent for geometry projection. minGroupExtent is the floor under every visible leaf; each split clamps between the requiredExtent of its two subtrees (leaf minimums sum through same-axis splits plus gaps, max across cross-axis splits), and an infeasible split degrades to the unclamped proportional partition."},
